{
"dur": 35.0,
"shots": [
{
"i": 1,
"start": 0.0,
"vo_start": 0.6,
"vo_end": 11.987,
"text": "Robert Pattinson was born in London in May 1986 and grew up in Barnes, by the Thames. His dad imported vintage cars from America. His mum worked at a modelling agency.",
"end": 12.262
},
{
"i": 2,
"start": 12.262,
"vo_start": 12.537,
"vo_end": 19.577,
"text": "He wasn't a stage-school kid. He joined a local amateur drama club as a teenager, by his own account partly because that's where the girls were.",
"end": 19.852
},
{
"i": 3,
"start": 19.852,
"vo_start": 20.127,
"vo_end": 28.22,
"text": "In 2005 that hobby turned into Harry Potter. He played Cedric Diggory, the golden Hogwarts champion in The Goblet of Fire, the one who doesn't make it out.",
"end": 28.495
},
{
"i": 4,
"start": 28.495,
"vo_start": 28.77,
"vo_end": 34.05,
"text": "Remember the producer on that film, David Heyman. He'll come back at the very end of this story.",
"end": 35.0
}
],
